      "dedupe_key": "insights-from-d-ad-annual-trend-report-2026|2026-09-30|d-ad-hq",
      "description": "Join us for drinks, networking and a deep-dive into key trends from the D&AD Awards 2026 with CCOO, Donal Keenan. The D&AD Awards celebrate the very best creative work across advertising and design. For work to win at D&AD, jurors needed to see flawless execution supporting the big, bold idea. This report delves into the emerging trends that defined D&AD Pencil-winning work in 2026. We rigorously analysed this year’s awarded work and pored over feedback from the jury rooms, where more than 300 world-leading designers, advertising experts and creatives came together to judge the very best in global creativity. We revisited interviews and Jury Insight sessions from D&AD Festival to uncover the ideas, approaches and shifts that emerged across the 46 categories awarded this year.",
